    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you may negate a melee attack by making a successful opposed attack roll. The DC of the attack roll is equal to the result of the attack roll you wish to negate, and you take a cumulative -5 penalty to your attack rolls to use this Talent for every time you have used <b>Cortosis Staff Block</b> since the beginning of your last turn.<br><br>You must have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cortosis_Staff\" title=\"Cortosis Staff\">Cortosis Staff</a> drawn to use this Talent, and you must be aware of the attack and not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a>. You may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to use this Talent to negate an attack against an adjacent character.",
